<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Lean Left</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Etheria is in a state of flux in the aftermath of the defeat of Horde Prime. With reparative work well underway, the rebellion welcomes new companions and new challenges in Bright Moon and beyond. Glimmer struggles to balance her grief and her duties as Queen, Entrapta and Hordak face the ceaseless struggle to understand and be understood, and Adora and Catra endeavor to persevere on the path towards healing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But when the Best Friends Squad Expanded Edition stumble upon ancient secrets that have the potential to change their lives forever, it is up to Glimmer to decide if its worth the risk. After all, what's more important than family?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>machashe</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
